|cFFFFFFFFThis spell belongs to |r|cFF0D2ED6Primalist|r

Create a seismic wave of healing water around you, healing for ${$m1+0+$SP*0.1+$AP*0.05} health to up to $i allies and dealing ${$m2+0+$SP*0.1+$AP*0.05} Nature damage to enemies in a $a1 yd radius.  

@ext:Shares a cooldown with other |CffffffffSeismic|r spells.:ext@

fr:
