en:
Hurl a spear in a $a1 yd frontal line, dealing $s3% Ranged Weapon Damage plus $s1, dealing less damage with each enemy struck.

At the spear's impact location the spear shatters, dealing ${$255846m2+$255846ppl2+$RAP*0.15} Physical damage to nearby enemies.

@ext:Shares a cooldown with other |cffffffffSpears|r.:ext@

